  (text "C64 +5V INPUT PROTECTION & FERRITE PI-FILTER" (at 35.56 35.56 0)
    (effects (font (size 2.4892 2.4892) (thickness 0.4978) bold) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 82000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000001)
  )
  (text "ZERO-DROP P-FET IDEAL DIODE + USB VBUS OR-ING\n(Pico 2 W Datasheet Section 3.4, Figure 10, p. 16)\n- When USB is unplugged (VBUS=0V): R3 pulls Q1 Gate to GND,\n  turning Q1 fully ON (Rds_on = 52mOhm, <3mV drop at 45mA).\n- When USB is plugged in (VBUS=5V): Q1 Gate is pulled to 5V,\n  turning Q1 OFF to block back-feeding into C64 +5V rail."
    (at 35.56 114.3 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom))
    (uuid 82000001-0000-4000-8000-000000000002)
  )

